      "With more than 30 public gardens within 30 miles of Greater Philadelphia, the Brandywine Valley is the heart of America’s Garden Capital. From the du Pont legacy of historic estates to naturalistic gardens, botanical beauty abounds. World-renowned Longwood Gardens is the crown jewel of this collection, featuring over a thousand acres of sweeping outdoor landscapes and masterfully curated garden displays in two magnificent indoor conservatories.",
