      "Fresno County is California's underground wine country, producing 20% of the state's total wine grapes—one in every five glasses of wine! Tastings are intimate, where visitors can meet the families operating the vineyards, and are a fraction of the price of other wine destinations. Stop at the family-owned Ziveli Winery, or 3 Oaks Vineyard & Winery in Clovis. Beer lovers, can stop in at the Downtown Fresno Brewery District.",
