      "From handmade crafts to music, immerse yourself in the work of local creative talents, or pursue your own artistic ambitions. Sometimes, the best way to travel is to do nothing – Highland County is the perfect place to sit back, relax, and recharge amidst the tranquil, quiet scenery. No matter the season, the community features events that are fun for all ages.",
