    visitSlug: "visit-sandia-resort",
    linkLabel: "Visit Sandia Resort",
    placeName: "Sandia Resort & Casino",
    stateName: "New Mexico",
    title: "Sandia Resort & Casino",
    dek: "At the foothills of the Sandia Mountains — spirit, flavor, and hospitality.",
    heroImage: "/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/01-src-exterior.jpg",
    gallery: ["/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/02-food2.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/03-sports-bar.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/04-casino.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/05-spa.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/06-golf-1.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/07-room.jpg","/destinations/spring-2026-web/visit-sandia-resort/08-pool.jpg"],
    paragraphs: [
      "Perched at the foothills of the Sandia Mountains, Sandia Resort & Casino is far more than a place to stay—it’s a destination that captures the spirit, flavors, and essence of New Mexico—in one unforgettable experience. From the moment of arrival, you will be present to something deeper than luxury alone. Owned and operated by the Pueblo of Sandia, the resort offers an authentic connection to the land and culture that have shaped this region for centuries.",
      "Every detail has been designed to maximize the guest experience. From the warm welcome at check-in, to the panoramic mountain and city views, and the regionally themed amenities, Sandia Resort & Casino is in a class by itself. The accommodations strike a rare balance between comfort and elegance. Spacious rooms and suites are designed with understated Southwestern touches and floor-to-ceiling windows that invite the landscape inside.",
      "Mornings begin with desert light spilling across the mountains; evenings end with the city twinkling below. Whether visiting for a weekend escape or a longer get-away, guests find a calm, restorative atmosphere that feels worlds away from everyday stress. What truly elevates Sandia Resort & Casino, however, is its dining scene. Food lovers will find the resort has quietly become one of the area’s most compelling culinary destinations.",
      "At the heart of it is Bien Shur, a fine-dining restaurant that pairs impeccable service with bold flavors, locally sourced ingredients and an exceptional wine list. Entrees, thoughtfully crafted sides and exceptional desserts are elevated by sweeping mountain views that make every meal feel like an occasion. It’s the kind of place where celebrations linger, and dinners turn into memories.",
      "For a more relaxed but equally satisfying experience, the Council Room and the Sandia Sports Bar are longtime favorites for locals and visitors alike. Known for their inventive takes on New Mexican-inspired cuisine, the restaurants blend regional ingredients with contemporary techniques. Red and green chile appear in surprising and refined ways, honoring tradition while pushing it forward.",
      "The result is food that feels distinctly New Mexican yet refreshingly modern—best enjoyed at sunset, when the mountains outside the windows glow in brilliant hues. Casual dining options round out the experience, offering everything from quick bites to comforting classics, all executed with care and consistency. No matter the setting, there’s a shared commitment to quality ingredients and hospitality that reflects pride in both the food and the guest experience.",
      "Beyond the table, Sandia Resort & Casino invites guests to unwind and play. The resort’s spa offers a tranquil retreat inspired by Indigenous traditions, with treatments designed to restore balance and well-being. The casino floor provides lively entertainment for those seeking excitement, while the outdoor pool area offers a serene place to relax beneath New Mexico’s famously blue skies.",
      "The amphitheater regularly hosts major acts across all genres, and the award-winning golf course is designed for novice and pro-golfers alike. What sets Sandia Resort & Casino apart is the way it weaves all of this together—luxury, culture, cuisine, and landscape—into a cohesive and meaningful stay. Guests are not simply passing through; they are participating in a living story of place and community. Each meal, each view, and each moment reflects a deep respect for the land and the people who call it home.",
      "For travelers who believe that the best food and travel experiences are rooted in authenticity, Sandia Resort & Casino delivers on every level. It is a place to savor New Mexico—its flavors, its beauty, and its spirit—one remarkable stay at a time.",
    ],
    ctaUrl: "https://www.sandiacasino.com/",
    ctaLabel: "Visit Sandia Resort & Casino",
